    "id": "178MzU8jNzBhl-Xymeo2TuRDmcHJS08ulxRemQ6318gM",
    "slug": "your-erp-vendor-sold-you-agents-nobody-asked-your-data",
    "title": "Your ERP Vendor Sold You Agents. Nobody Asked Your Data.",
    "teaser": "SAP now ships dozens of Joule agents that can post transactions on their own, and Microsoft wired Copilot into the mix. Readiness research says most companies are about to hand power tools to master data that cannot carry the weight.",
    "category": "ERP",
